window.products.push({"id":1178054,"name":"Premium 12/2 Awg 100ft CL2 Speaker Wire | Cable - Oxygen Free Copper","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319-+vJYL5L._AC_.jpg","description":"It's often argued that using name brand, or high quality speaker wires can bring out the best performance from any high quality speaker system. While there is some merit to the idea of using high quality cables, it seems many companies have taken this idea far beyond it's logical limits and in so doing created a whole new snake oil industry. Bottom line, when it comes to speaker wire, if they’re talking about special alloys, magical filaments or direction specific wires and charging tens, hundreds or even thousands of dollars per foot, chances are, they’ve probably crossed the line. The truth is, one of the best materials for transferring electrical signals is pure copper. Higher grade copper will offer less signal resistance and have less tendency to corrode or tarnish underneath the jacket. Monoprice offers high purity, oxygen-free, all copper speaker wires that deliver high fidelity, wide frequency range and low signal loss. These cables are capable of delivering loud, clear and crisp audio reproduction limited only by the quality of the equipment you are using. If you're looking for a décor friendly cable, look no further than the Monoprice CL2 rated speaker cable. They come with a white outer jacket to blend in with your walls and baseboards for out of wall applications and are CL2 rated to meet most building codes * for installation behind the walls when you want to keep the cables completely out of sight. These cables are made from high purity, oxygen free copper, are available in a variety of gauges and come in 2 conductor and 4 conductor configurations. The 4 conductor cables are perfect for bi-wiring high end tower speakers that offer a bi-wireable option.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319-+vJYL5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"diyhometheatersupply","source_asin":"B003YEHKYS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178054","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003YEHKYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003YEHKYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1178055,"name":"Artman Upgraded Action Camera Accessories Kit 61-in-1Compatible with GoPro Hero 10/9/8 Black, GoPro Fusion, Max, Hero 7 6 5 4 3 2 1 Black Silver SJ400","category":"electronics","retail price":27.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iWqj9WD9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Extensive Compatibility and Wide Application for Gopro Hero 9 Accessories Kit】: These Gopro accessories are perfectly compatible with GoPro Max, GoPro Fusion, Hero 10/9/8/7/6/5/4/3+/3/2/1 Black Silver SJ4000/ SJ5000/ SJ6000, also for DJI OSMO ACTION, SJCAM SJ4000 5000 6000 7000 Yi,Insta360 AKASO APEMAN Campark, and there are perfect suitable for Vlog,Skiing,Cycling,Canoe,Diving, Skydiving,Swimming,Surfing,Biking,Biking,Climbing, Snowboarding, and more other outdoor high-speed sports activities. 【Upgraded Multi-Functions Black Strong Selfie Stick For Hero 9 black accessories】: Artman action camera accessory kit includes an upgraded black selfie stick, which is stronger and has multiple functions. You can adjust the distance of the phone clip at will. At the same time, you can install your action camera at the far end of the selfie stick. The phone and GoPro camera can take selfies or videos at the same time. 【Various Straps For GoPro Camera Accessories】: The wrist strap with a screw can fix your action camera on the strap, the angle can be adjusted freely. The flexible chest belt strap is used to equip your action camera comfortably. A vented Helmet Strap helps to attach an action camera to the forehead, which provides a wider angle and horizon. These hero 9 bundle accessories are perfect is suitable for all kinds of sports like skating, climbing, biking, boating, and skiing. 【Floating Handle Grip + Remote Wrist Strap +12psc Anti-fog Inserts + Wrench Spanner Screw Tool are in GoPro mounts and accessories】：Floating Handle Grip - Strip design makes it easier grip and the bright yellow color makes it clear to spot if it gets away. Remote Wrist Strap help to attach the remote to the wrist. Anti-fog Inserts could absorb moisture to prevent lens fogging. Wrench Spanner Screw Tool helps to open the waterproof case since the hand is very slippery after diving. 【Bike Handlebar Mount & Suction Cup in Action Accessories Kit 】: These GoPro clamp mounts are suitable for rods with diameters ranging from 0.75 - 1.4 inch on tubes, frames, or other objects, with the three-way adjustable pivot arm, And you can achieve the effect of adjusting the size of the interface by turning the screw, regardless of the size of your bike or motorcycle handlebar, it can be easily and securely installed on your bike or motorcycle handlebar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iWqj9WD9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A Artman","source_asin":"B09YD67KRK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178055","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YD67KRK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YD67KRK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
