window.products.push({"id":1178107,"name":"Kelty Cache Box","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zMybKUEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sensitive electronics and rugged outdoor environments don’t always mix. That’s why Kelty developed the Cache Box. Available in three sizes and designed to accommodate everything from tablets and e-readers to smart phones and cameras, each Cache Box features internal elastic straps and pockets to keep cords and small parts secure. A molded EVA top and bottom combines with stiff sides and a microfleece liner to offer outstanding protection for your valuables.. Small size is perfect for sunglasses, MP3 players, cameras, GPS, and other small electronics.. Medium size is perfect for ski goggles, helmet cams and other accessories. . Large size is perfect for tablets, lanterns, larger cameras and lenses, or a combination of smaller items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zMybKUEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kelty","source_asin":"B009R8PEAM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178107","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009R8PEAM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B009R8PEAM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1178108,"name":"Wirecare F6 - Self Wrapping Braided Sleeving - 3/8 - Black 10 ft piece","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uVHmgV2GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flexo F6's unique split, semi-rigid braided construction make it the ideal solution for situations where ease of installation is of primary importance. The lateral split allows the tube to open up to accommodate a wide variety of bundling requirements, and the semi-rigid braid configuration simply closes around the entire installation without the need for any additional fasteners (velcro, tape, etc.). The 10 mil PET braid is lightweight, quiet and flexible. The 25% edge overlap (at nominal diameter) allows coverage around inline plugs, connectors and splices. F6 will bend to a tight radius without distorting or splitting open and, unlike full rigid tubing, will not impair or affect the flexibility of harnesses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uVHmgV2GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wirecare","source_asin":"B00UIAW6NQ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178108","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UIAW6NQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UIAW6NQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
