window.products.push({"id":1178255,"name":"MAGCH Digital Picture Frame WiFi 10 inch IPS Touch Screen HD Display, Digital Photo Frame with 16GB Storage, Auto-Rotate, Share Photos via App, Email,","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PsKPa1egL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A BEST GIFT FOR YOUR LOVED ONES: MAGCH digital photo frame equipped with premium materials and style to enhance your home decor. This digital picture frame is sure to be a heart-warming surprise for your grand-parents, parents or anyone who would like to share important moments in your family. Choose it as a gift to store the memories for all your loved ones at any celebrate days. EXTRAODINARY PICTURE DISPLAY: MAGCH WiFi picture frame comes with a 1280x800 resolution and 16: 10 aspect ratio touchscreen which gives you a wonderful viewing experience. Browse through photos, delete videos, or pause the slideshow, with a quick tap of the finger. There are 4 calendar themes in a calendar frame mode, you can change a loved one. And also you can set up the alarm clock time and schedule for the elderly through your phone app(Biu Frame app). SPECIAL DESIGN FOR MAGCH PHOTO FRAME: You can position this digital frame any way, portrait or landscape on tabletop, and also your pictures or videos can automatically rotate. Send photos or videos(up to 15s) to the frame through email or the APP \"Biu Frame\", you can choose the most important contect of your photos before sending to get a best viewing angle. Equipped with motion sensor and sleep mode and light sensor mode, the MAGCH frame can give you a wonderful experience. UNLIMITED FREE STORAGE: With a built-in 16GB storage, you can save around 40.000 photos(300KB/pc) into this digital frame. It also supports the SD card(up to 128GB) and USB drive(connect it with an OTG cable to the type-c port) to upload, backup, and restore files. Instantly share photos from your phone to the MAGCH wifi digital frame through APP \"Biu Frame\", and also you can invite 20 friends and famlies to share pictures to your digital frame. EASY SET UP AND TRUSTED: User-friendly interface design makes it easy-to-use for the elderly or kids. Just plug MAGCH photo frame in, tap the touch screen to log into your WiFi first(Only works with 2.4 GHz), then your Frame ID and email address will be generated automatically. Our Customer Service team is here to help you if you have questions about your MAGCH Smart Frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PsKPa1egL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAGCH","source_asin":"B0B1WC6W6G","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178255","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1WC6W6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1WC6W6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
