window.products.push({"id":1178315,"name":"UGREEN 3.5mm Audio Cable Hi-Fi Sound Stereo Nylon Braided Male to Male Aux Cord 90 Degree Aux Cable Gold Plated Compatible with iPod iPad Tablets Head","category":"electronics","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gf72+K5LS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UGREEN 3.5mm Audio Cable: Right Angle 3.5mm aux cord streams playlist from output(line-out) device to input (line-in) device directly, compatible with Samsung/LG phone to headphone, smart TV to Hi-Fi speaker, iPod to car stereo radio. This male to male 3.5mm audio cable allows you to enjoy superior music on high-end audio output devices. Plus, this auxiliary cable is the perfect cable for headphones/earphones/speakers whose original audio cables get broken. Hi-Fi Sound & Shieldings Protection: Hi-Fi can highly restore the real sound and keep the sound delicate. 1/8 stereo cable is well constructed and offers a remarkable stereo sound experience to you. This aux jack lead is a combination of enameled copper conductors, 24K gold-plated connectors, and double shieldings(TPE jacket plus nylon braid). The shieldings protect the audio against RF, EM, and ground loop interference during transmission and provide noise-free and ultra-clear sound quality. Right Angle Design: 3.5mm male to male stereo aux cable features a 90-degree right-angled aux jack and an ultra-slim straight aux jack. The right-angled jack connector keeps this stereo audio cable from bending while used in narrow places, which is great for protecting the cable from cracking. With a slim aux connector, you can connect this stereo audio lead to your phone/tablet without taking off the protective case. Enhanced Durability: Manufactured by evolved braided nylon, nylon braided aux cord passed 10000+ bend tests and is strong enough to withstand any twist, tug, and tangle. Oxygen-free copper provides maximum conductivity and durability. The extended wire joint design protects this auxiliary cable from bending. Universal Use: With standard 3.5mm male jacks, this 3.5mm audio cable male to male compatible with snugly devices like car stereo radio, MacBook Pro/Air, Surface Pro, iMac, laptop, desktop, Switch Lite, PS4, Xbox One, smartphones(like iPhone 6/SE, Samsung S10 Plus/S9/S8/S7/A70/A50/A20e/A10, Moto G7 Power/G6, Sony Xperia L1/XA2/Z5), iPad, iPad 9, iPod, tablet, MP3/MP4 player, smart TV, walkman, Beats headphone, speaker, soundbox, amp.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gf72+K5LS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UGREEN","source_asin":"B09DSWJ1LN","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178315","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DSWJ1LN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DSWJ1LN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
