window.products.push({"id":1178416,"name":"KENOBEE Case for iPad 10.2 inch 9th / 8th / 7th Generation (2021/2020/2019), 360° Rotating Handle-Kickstand Shockproof Cover Built-in Screen Protector","category":"electronics","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713+m5bLH9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Model Fits: Specially design for iPad 9th Generation 2021 (A2602/A2603/A2604/A2605), iPad 8th Generation 2020 (A2270/A2428/A2429/A2430), iPad 7th Generation 2019 (A2197/A2200/A2198) 10.2\" Tablet. NOT compatible with other iPad models. Please confirm the model on the back of your iPad before purchase. Durable Protection: 3-layer shockproof Heavy Duty Rugged protection case for iPad, combined with 1-layer soft silicone and 2-layer hard polycarbonate front frame and back cover, providing perfect protection for your iPad against accidental drops, scratches, shocks and dust, helping keep your iPad as beautiful as the day you take it out of the box. Integrated front cover screen protector prevents scratches without sacrificing sensitivity or visibility. Totally kid friendly product for your iPad. Rotating Ring Grip & Pencil Holder: 360 degree Multi-Functional Rotatable foldable Ring offers multiple angles for enjoying the most comfortable keyboard-typing and movie-viewing. And it can also serve as a handle, convenient for holding and carrying around. Elastic iPad Pencil Pocket will carry your iPad Pencil in security, keep the iPad Pencil protected and safe.( Pencil is NOT included). Removable & Adjustable Shoulder Strap: The portable shoulder strap helps you carry your iPad conveniently when you are at work, on a trip or outdoors. It can be attached to any two holes in the PC cover to carry your device vertically or horizontally like a messenger bag, you could even hang it behind the head rest of car seat or wherever you want. The length of the shoulder strap can be adjusted to fit adults or kids. Precise Cutouts: Precise cutout design ensures face recognition and access to fingerprint, speaker and all other features. Port plugs of the case prevents dust from entering into iPad.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713+m5bLH9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KENOBE","source_asin":"B0936KNP2F","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178416","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0936KNP2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0936KNP2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1178417,"name":"Vidpro GP-22 Gripster Tripod for DSLR or Camcorder + Adapter for iPhone 5, 5s, 6, 6 Plus, HTC One, Galaxy S2, S3, S4, S5, S6 BlackBerry Z10,Q10, Motor","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EcUPatslL._AC_.jpg","description":"Gripster is the ideal camera accessory for photographers on the go. Throw it in your pocket or backpack and you'll be ready for your next adventure! While the Gripster serves all the functions of a traditional camera tripod - steadying your camera under low-light conditions, taking timed group shots, etc. - it is the only tripod malleable enough to provide you with the perfect shot while wrapped around a tree branch, hanging from a pole, or perched on a jagged rock. The possibilities are endless! When your digital camera needs support for unique photo shoots, an ordinary tripod might not be able to tackle the job. The Gripster is the lightest and most versatile camera tripod available today. Featuring over two dozen flexible leg joints that bend and rotate, the Gripster will firmly secure your compact digital camera to virtually any surface!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EcUPatslL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VidPro","source_asin":"B01BMZQ4Z6","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178417","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BMZQ4Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BMZQ4Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
