window.products.push({"id":1178426,"name":"S Unite Star 18 Inch Carry On Luggage with Front Laptop Pocket, Lightweight Hardshell ABS+PC+Aluminum Frame Suitcase with TSA Lock, USB Charge Port, 3","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4102zPpZoTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Front Laptop Pocket & Aluminum Frame Design: The 18 inch luggage is designed with front laptop pocket by size 16.14*9.84*17.71in, weight 6.6Ibs. Aluminum frame design offers more load bear than other normal luggages. The front laptop pocket fit for 15.6in laptop or Ipad or books. Note: Maybe this size is not suitable for carrying on the plane, please refer to the size restrictions of each airline. Large Capacity & Multiple Compartments: The front compartment has multi-layer storage mezzanine. And the Internal structure is included interlayer zipper bag, document bag, X-shaped fixing belt, offering a large capacity for your short business trip. Multiple compartments help to keep things neat and orderly. TSA Approved & USB Charge Port: TSA combination Lock offers doubles security. Recessed customs lock on top for easy access to front pocket. Ingenious layout for one lock with two zippers controls two compartment, one zipper controls the front position and the other controls the main position. USB charging port for easy charging even if you are walking. Please Note: pover bank is not included. Firmly Pull Rod & Silent Spinner Wheels: High-strength three-section aluminum alloy rod durable, smooth and easy to close with one button. Silent 360 degree spinner wheels are made of high-elastic thick nylon shock-absorbing material. With excellent load-bearing and shock-absorbing capabilities, which is good to use in a variety of road conditions. Firm and tight axles, ensuring smoothness and reducing noise. No-worry After Sales: Unite Star products are rigorously tested to ensure the products meet stringent standards. This suitcase comes with a 2-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. We provide 7*24 hours customer's service. Any problem please feel free to contact us, we will give you a satisfy solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4102zPpZoTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S Unite Star","source_asin":"B0B2D4VDWT","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178426","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2D4VDWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2D4VDWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1178427,"name":"Vanguard Alta Sky 45D Camera Backpack for Sony, Nikon, Canon, DSLR, Drones","category":"electronics","retail price":179.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+-R3LjmdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Alta Sky 45D is a dynamic backpack that sets a new standard for adaptable carrying and working solutions. It offers versatility combined with reliable gear protection like never before. Featuring innovative 1/3-2/3 division the larger compartment can be fully accessed from the rear, quickly reached from the side, or separately opened from the top, while the smaller compartment enjoys quick individual opening from the bottom front. The multitude of dividers and access points leave you the choice of just how much professional gear and how much personal gear to carry. Maximum capacity can fit up to a Pro DSLR with attached lens (up to 70-200mm f/2. 8), 2-3 lenses, a flash, and accessories in the top 2/3 compartment and a CSC (compact system camera) with additional lens in the bottom 1/3 compartment. If carrying less gear one can easily turn this backpack into a day pack or hiking backpack, deciding which separate access point is for photo gear and which is for personal or hiking gear. Secure rear compartment protects up to a 13” laptop and can also fit a tablet in the additional padded sleeve (note that double usage is only possible for some laptop + tablet combinations). organize all other gear and personal essentials exactly where you need them; either secured in an organizer pocket, or on hand at any given moment in a slip-in pocket. Stay hydrated with two large side pockets for water bottles. Link, hang, and sling on anything you can imagine using the multitude of straps, loops and innovative connection features integrated into the surface of the backpack. Designed to carry heavy gear loads for extended periods of time, we set the bar for comfortable carrying at a new high. Our advanced ergonomic back and harness system features a well-padded breathable 3D back, uniquely shaped easy to adjust shoulder straps that perfectly contour to your back and torso, adjustable sternum strap, and well-padded supporting waist belt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+-R3LjmdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANGUARD","source_asin":"B07DWMQHNZ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178427","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DWMQHNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DWMQHNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
