window.products.push({"id":1178447,"name":"Mobi Purist Headphonies Designer Mini Portable Speaker (Discontinued by the Manufacturer) - 70133","category":"electronics","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x0dKUOqwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Headphonies are fun, affordable, ultra-portable 3-inch designer speakers that plug into your mobile device--smartphone, iPod, iPad, or portable MP3 or CD player. Each design has a unique personality and attitude, but they all provide the same full sound. Enjoy Headphonies wherever you go. Collect your favorite characters and trade them with your friends for even more fun. You can also link two Headphonies to your source with the optional audio splitter for fuller playback. Headphonies include a quick-charging lithium-ion battery, (four hours of play time per charge), a USB charger cord, an audio cord, and a clip-tether. Headphonies fit in the palm of your hand but have a big sound. View larger . Unique, Urban, Vinyl-Style Designs Mobi Headphonies were inspired by urban vinyl figures, a style of designer and collector toy that has recently become very popular (while Headphonies speakers aren't actually vinyl, they share many characteristics of the market and style). The speakers feature a stout, humanoid shape with an oversize head--an aesthetic that is characteristic of urban vinyl. They are also an ideal collector's item: each Headphonies was designed by a different artist, and is only available for a limited time. The Purist Headphonies was designed with minimalists in mind. Its unique personality is displayed in its creamy white finish, with no other colors or embellishments. Headphonies are charged via USB. View larger . Impressive Sound, Tiny Footprint In spite of their compact size, Headphonies microspeakers have some serious playback capabilities. Each Headphonies has a round speaker grille on the back of its head, concealing the speaker underneath. Using amplified DSP (Digital Signal Processor) circuitry, the loudspeaker provides clear bass and frequency response, pumping out your music in tight detail, without the tinny distortion that usually plagues portable speakers. You also have the option of linking two Headphonies together with an audio splitter (sold separately) to achieve true stereo sound. Compact Design for Maximum Portability At 3 inches tall and weighing only 4 ounces, Headphonies are compact enough to fit into your pocket or handbag. As long as you have an MP3 player or another mobile device, you'll be able to play back your music wherever you go--whether you're on the road, at your desk, or in the company of friends. Compatible with a Range of Mobile Devices The Purist Headphonies is compatible with a variety of mobile gadgets, including iPods, iPhones, Nintendo DS, Sony PSP, and more. It includes a cable for connecting to your device as well as a charging cable for the internal battery. The internal battery can be charged in approximately one hour with a playback time of up to six hours per charge. To save on energy, Headphonies automatically power down when not in use. The Mobi Purist Headphonies speaker is backed by a 90-day limited warranty. What's in the Box Purist Headphonies microspeaker, clip-on tether, USB charging cord, audio input cord, and product instructions. Mobi Purist HeadphoniesAt a Glance: Limited edition, collectible, portable speaker with a unique style Limited edition, collectible, portable speaker with a unique style Amplified DSP (Digital Signal Processor) circuitry provides clear bass and frequency response Amplified DSP (Digital Signal Processor) circuitry provides clear bass and frequency response Trendy design inspired by urban vinyl Trendy design inspired by urban vinyl Compact, durable, and USB-powered for easy portability Compact, durable, and USB-powered for easy portability Rechargeable Lithium Ion battery lasts up to six hours on a one-hour charge Rechargeable Lithium Ion battery lasts up to six hours on a one-hour charge Backed by a 90-day limited warranty Backed by a 90-day limited warranty Headphonies pair wonderfully with MP3 players and music-enabled phones. (Koko pictured above.) View larger . Each collectible Headphonies is designed by a different artist and available for a limited time.  Click your favorite.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x0dKUOqwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOBI","source_asin":"B00378PMUA","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178447","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00378PMUA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00378PMUA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
