window.products.push({"id":1178556,"name":"RCA Multi-Directional, Flat Digital Indoor HDTV Antenna","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31y0jrGvTwL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description With the 360 degree patented reception technology, this indoor antenna eliminates the constant need to adjust to get a great picture. Just hang it, lay it flat, or stand it upright and receive all available local digital HD broadcasts for free. This high gain antenna will outperform traditional antennas due to the patented design. The sleek, slim profile and streamlined shape complements any home theater set up. From the Manufacturer Set Your TV Free with the RCA ANT1600 Digital Flat Antenna Patented 360º Design Outperforms Traditional Antennas Dress-up your entertainment room with the sleek RCA ANT1600 piano black digital flat antenna.  The included easel props the antenna up so it can stand alone, opening more possibilities on where to place the antenna in your home.  RCA Digital flat antennas are designed specifically for digital TV signals, which require more precise directional reception than analog signals to give you consistent performance.  Digital TV provides crystal-clear digital picture and sound, but to get uninterrupted reception your antenna needs to be aimed in exactly the right direction.  RCA’s unique and patented antenna designs eliminate the guess work in digital reception, finding and delivering great digital picture and sound without the hassle of manual adjustments. Slim Profile disappears into surroundings Coax Cable built in 360º of Reception means no missed signal Paintable Surface blends antenna into any surrounding   Top Four Reasons to Purchase an Antenna 1.    Simply put, the best HD is in the air. 2.    Get free HD, and more free channels too.  3.    Even cable and satellite users deserve the best quality.  4.    Say good-bye to adjusting old rabbit ears – 360º reception delivers the best signal. Paint the digital flat antenna to disguise  it as part of your wall or room accessory Receives local HD and  all digital TV broadcasts Supports 1080  resolution reception Receive reception regardless where the antenna is placed Paintable RCA digital flat indoor antennas No longer does superior reception for your home theater system mean having to compromise the aesthetic appeal of your living room.  In addition to their sleek design, RCA digital flat antennas are paintable.  Simply match any color you like to go along with your home palette and watch this state-of-the-art antenna disappear into its surroundings.  It’s just one more way RCA antennas deliver convenient and practical solutions.        All of RCA's digital flat antennas have a unique design that eliminates constant adjustments.    Simply hang it, lay it flat or stand it up!     Enjoy superior reception from the RCA ANT1600 digital flat antenna What’s in the Box: Digital flat antenna and coax cable  Find the right antenna for your area Digital TV signals require better reception than analog TV signals to provide satisfactory performance (i.e. a watchable picture).  If you used to get a snowy (but watchable) picture on your analog TV channels, you may find that your new digital channels do not have strong enough signals to display in this new format.  Whether you live in the trees, on the plains, or in the midst of hills, make sure you find the right antenna for your individual needs. B001GGAIIQ B001GEDVLO B001GE6T9A B00196757K B001GE6TA4 B0027FZQ1E B0027FGW3K ANT1400 ANT1450 ANT1450B ANT1500 ANT1550 ANT1600 ANT1650 Receives FREE uncompressed digital signals • • • • • • • Designed for DTV • • • • • • • Supports 1080 • • • • • • • Receives ALL signals without adjustment • • • • • • • Signal reception qualifier Excellent Excellent Excellent Superior Superior Superior Superior Signal amplifier • •   •   • Outdoor application Disappears into surroundings • • • • • • • Slim profile • • • • • • • Paintable • • • • • • • Coax cable • • • • • • • Easel stand • • • •   • Power adapter • •   •   • Mounting Hardware • •       RCA is the world leader in digital antenna technology.  And as such, they are proud to be the first in the world to offer their customers the unmatched quality and convenience of digital television through their line of indoor digital antennas.  The RCA line of products offer superior functionality and have been carefully designed to integrate seamlessly and easily into any home environment.   One-Year Limited Warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31y0jrGvTwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RCA","source_asin":"B0027FZQ1E","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178556","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0027FZQ1E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0027FZQ1E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
