window.products.push({"id":1178675,"name":"Fosmon Green Glow in the Dark Silicone Apple TV (2nd Gen) Siri Remote Case [AirTag Holder], Full Body Shockproof Cushion Cover with Built-in AirTag Sl","category":"electronics","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wB9SMzn8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[COMPATIBLE WITH APPLE TV 4K 2021] Got a brand new Apple TV but concerned about damaging the remote when accidentally dropped? No Worries, Fosmon has the perfect 2021 Apple TV 4k 2nd generation Siri Remote and 2021 Apple AirTag Silicone Case. Fosmon Apple TV Remote Case is designed specifically for the 2nd generation Siri Apple TV. Please check your Apple TV before purchase. This case is not compatible with the 4th (HD) and 4K (5th) 1st Generation Siri Remote Controller. [APPLE AIRTAG SLOT] Tired of taking the couch apart to find your Apple TV remote? With the Fosmon Silicone Apple TV Remote Case, there is no need for treasure hunting anymore! Fosmon Apple TV Remote Case provides an AirTag slot ensuring you never have to check between couch cushions again. Insert an Apple AirTag into the included space, pair it with your phone, and you’ll be able to find your Apple TV remote in an instant. [ULTIMATE PROTECTION] No longer needing to worry about your Apple TV remote being cracked or scratched from day-to-day use. With up to 10ft/3m height impact absorption, Fosmon Silicone Apple TV Remote and AirTag Case raised edges and deep cushioning will not only protect your Apple TV remote but also your AirTag looking as good as brand new. This case will not interfere with any of the ports, buttons, or microphone, and providing a wide front cutout ensures that the IR blaster is not blocked. [GLOW IN THE DARK] In the dark trying to find the Apple TV remote is always a hassle when looking for your Apple TV 4k 2nd generation Siri remote. Now you will never lose your Apple TV remote in the dark again. Fosmon Silicone Apple TV Remote Case prevents cracks and scratches but also glows your Apple TV remote in the dark. The glow in the dark material can be charged using any direct light source including sunlight, lamps, and general house lighting. [LIMITED LIFETIME WARRANTY] This product comes with a limited lifetime warranty. Please refer to Fosmon’s website for more information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wB9SMzn8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fosmon","source_asin":"B09HKZQYCD","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178675","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HKZQYCD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HKZQYCD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
