window.products.push({"id":1178698,"name":"Tamron 18-400mm f/3.5-6.3 Di II VC HLD Lens for Canon EF w/Tripod Bundle (Tamron 6 Year Limited USA Warranty)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614+1d9ywRL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"Go to extremes with the Tamron 18-400mm F/3.5-6.3 Di II VC HLD Lens for Canon Cameras 22.2x ultra-telephoto all-in-one zoom for the APS-C format. With a focal length range of 18-400mm and 22.2x zoom, it has an ultra-telephoto range equivalent to 620mm in the 35mm format. This brings distant subjects closer, while providing perspective-flattening effects that are only possible with an extreme telephoto lens. Plus it offers exceptional optical performance across the entire zoom range-from wide angle to ultra-telephoto. Tamron’s VC (Vibration Compensation) technology stabilizes the image in the viewfinder, so you can frame your subject and shoot a sharp image even at ultra-telephoto ranges and in poorly lit conditions. Tamron’s HLD (High/Low torque-modulated Drive) saves power while providing superior drive. It focuses accurately and quietly while adjusting the motor’s rotation from low to high speeds, enabling smooth autofocusing. HLD let us design a space-saving AF module, for a sleeker barrel and reduced overall lens size. With its moisture resistant construction. this Tamron lens brings the art of photography to the joy of travel. Now you can use the same lens to shoot everything from stunning landscapes and neon-lit cities to detailed portraits and delicate flora. The ultra-telephoto range makes it just as easy to photograph animals and sports. And with a maximum magnification ratio of 1:2.9, you can even enjoy tele-macro photography. Bundle Includes: Tamron 18-400mm f/3.5-6.3 Di II VC HLD Lens for Canon Cameras Tamron 18-400mm f/3.5-6.3 Di II VC HLD Lens for Canon Cameras Photo & Video Backpack Photo & Video Backpack Vivitar 57\" Tripod (Black) Vivitar 57\" Tripod (Black) Top Brand 77mm 3-Piece Filter Kit UV/CPL/WM Top Brand 77mm 3-Piece Filter Kit UV/CPL/WM Focus Accessories for 260 Bag Focus Accessories for 260 Bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614+1d9ywRL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tamron","source_asin":"B07N7ZHF6C","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178698","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N7ZHF6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N7ZHF6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1178699,"name":"C. Crane CC Pocket AM FM and NOAA Weather Radio with Clock and Sleep Timer","category":"electronics","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YuhemUwNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The CC Pocket is very easy to use and has excellent overall performance. It has five easy to use memory buttons and it stands upright for convenience and best audio through the speaker. The sides are rubber coated to provide a firm grip and to help protect the radio if dropped. The Stereo/Mono/Speaker switch allows you to listen to the radio via the built-in speaker while using earphones as an antenna for the FM and NOAA Weather Bands. It is not common for a radio to block a strong signal that overrides a favorite weaker station. The CC Pocket has excellent selectivity while providing maximum sensitivity to weak signal. Standard Features: - Clear, precise and pleasing audio for its size - About 75 hours of play on (2) AA batteries (not included) with earbuds. 25 hrs. using 1.25\", 16ohm, .5W built-in speaker - Premium earbuds included for providing rich lows and crisp highs while listening - Backlight, sleep timer, clock and alarm, removable belt clip (no auto shut-off) - Battery meter, Signal meter, stereo or mono FM reception indicator - Works with rechargeable batteries. C. Crane loves to design radios for the connoisseur but we don’t want to make radios too complex. The CC Pocket has advanced hidden features not normally found on a pocket radio. Pressing the #1 and #5 keys at the same time, while listening to an AM station, disables the display screen. This allows you to reduce noise and improve AM radio reception under some circumstances. Advanced Features: - NOAA Weather Radio with Alert (disables AM/FM radio while activated) - Five memory pages for AM/FM - Selectable frequency or clock display while listening - Beep on or off - 1, 9 or 10 KHz selectable tuning steps - Selectable Narrow or Wide AM filter - Factory reset control Size 2.5\" W x 4.25\" H x 1\" D, Weight: 4 Oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YuhemUwNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C. Crane","source_asin":"B00BSYCZZ0","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178699","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BSYCZZ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BSYCZZ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
