window.products.push({"id":1178803,"name":"JVC XL-PG39 Personal CD Player with ASP-EXtreme Anti-Shock Protection (Diamond Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414CEZAVDBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description In a cool black shell with a tribal tattoo logo, this JVC Personal CD Player with 45-second shock protection is an all-around rockin' choice. Features: 20-hour playback with alkaline batteries, overhead headphones, Hyper-Bass sound with on/off select, high-performing ASP-EX (Extreme) advanced shock protection, 20-track programming and heat-resistant casing. 1-3/16Hx5-5/16Wx5-11/16D\". Weight: 8.3 oz. Amazon.com The JVC XL-PG39 is a portable CD player which will play audio CDs, plus CD-R/RW discs. The player's anti-skip system is JVC's advanced ASP-EX (extreme) system. This feature is a technological advancement over traditional anti-shock systems. The ASP-EX system gives the player forty-five seconds of memory, making the player a nice choice for people who like to listen to their favorite CDs while exercising or while commuting on the bus. If you decide to purchase a few key optional accessories, this player could be used in a vehicle's cassette player; the diamond black color would certainly look stylish in a car or truck. Yet, even without the optional accessories, the player is a nice choice for portable listening. There are a few play mode options, including normal play, repeat, random, and twenty-track program. The required batteries will run the player for an impressive twenty hours (alkaline.) Assisting you in saving battery life, the auto power-off feature turns the player off when not in use after a certain amount of time. For those interested in throwing away fewer alkaline batteries, the player is ready to run on rechargeable batteries. Sound quality is much improved with the hyper-bass sound system. Other features include: hold switch, 1-bit D/A converter, DC input, overhead stereo headphones and heat-resistant casing. What's in the Box JVC XL-PG39 personal CD player, overhead stereo headphones, user's manual and a one year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414CEZAVDBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JVC","source_asin":"B000093USY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178803","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000093USY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000093USY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1178804,"name":"Panasonic K-KJ55KHC86A Eneloop pro High Capacity Rechargeable Batteries Power Pack 8AA, 6AAA, 4 Hour Quick Battery Charger and Plastic Storage Case","category":"electronics","retail price":80.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SlKoJDk5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"eneloop pro AA and AAA NiMH ready to use rechargeable batteries utilize Panasonic advanced rechargeable battery technology, allowing them to be recharged up to 500 times. eneloop pro AA and AAA rechargeable batteries deliver consistent power performance, maintain 85% of their charge for up to 1 year (when not in use and stored properly), come pre-charged by solar power (at the factory) and are ready to use out of the package. These eneloop pro batteries also feature extreme temperature performance down to -4 deg F. Pair eneloop pro and eneloop AA and AAA batteries with Panasonic advanced, quick advanced, or super quick advance eneloop pro chargers to maximize your rechargeable battery experience. The Panasonic eneloop pro BQ-CC55, 4-position Ni-MH battery charger can quickly, and individually charge any combination of up to four AA or AAA eneloop pro batteries in just 4 hours (one to two AA or AAA batteries can be fully charged in up to just 2 hours). Individual charging means you can easily and efficiently charge from 1 to 4 batteries with differing levels of remaining charge. A huge time saver! The CC55 charger also features 4 individual LED charge indicator lights. Once batteries are installed, the charger measures each cell and the corresponding light indicates the remaining charge; Green 80 to 100%, Orange 20% to 80%, and Red 0% to 20%. After each battery reaches the next level of charging the LED light changes to indicate the cells charge level. Once the battery is completely charged, the LED light turns off for that cell. Ideal for use at home, in the office, or on the road, this Panasonic CC55 charger is a quick and convenient way to recharge any combination of up to four AA or AAA Ni-MH eneloop pro, eneloop, or conventional Panasonic Ni-MH rechargeable batteries..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SlKoJDk5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"eneloop","source_asin":"B0C2VKWKJD","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1178804","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2VKWKJD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2VKWKJD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
